abstract: >-
  Exact finite cocycle verification, a written all-degree explicit bar homotopy,
  and an exceptional-parameter classification of a specified seed resolution,
  supported by exact finite-field and independent binary-matrix replays.
  OpenAI supplied the source construction and generic Lean exactness arguments.
  Substantial OpenAI Codex assistance and scoped AI reviews are disclosed.
  The full counterexample, alternative constructions, kernel proof of these
  notes, human peer review and global novelty remain outside scope.
